// Halberd Coupe body: a mid-90s front-engined inline-six twin-turbo grand tourer, 2+2.
//
// Intent: a very long, smooth hood over the six, the cabin set well back, a rounded roof
// sweeping into a long fastback glass and a short, high tail with a small wing on posts.
// Slim rectangular lamps over a wide mouth, a soft shoulder, black glass trim, two oval
// lamps per side at the tail and five-spoke alloys. Front engine, rear drive. Generic
// period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
